<view class="page chat-page"><view class="eyebrow">COMPANION</view><view class="title">陪伴</view><view class="subtitle">你说的每一句，我都认真听</view><view class="card hero compact"><view class="badge online">在线陪伴中</view><view class="hero-title">今天想聊点什么？</view><view class="hero-copy">开心、委屈、疲惫，或只是想安静待一会儿，都可以。</view><view class="sun"></view></view><scroll-view class="messages" scroll-y scroll-into-view="last"><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index" id="{{index === messages.length - 1 ? 'last' : ''}}" class="bubble {{item.role}}"><view>{{item.text}}</view><view wx:if="item.role === 'bot'" class="speak" bindtap="speak" data-text="{{item.text}}">让小陪读出来</view></view></scroll-view><view class="composer"><input value="{{input}}" bindinput="input" confirm-type="send" bindconfirm="send" placeholder="和小陪说点什么…"/><button bindtap="send" loading="{{sending}}">发送</button></view></view>
